DAQ_IOMC - PowerDNA / UEIPAC kernel modules (pdnadev.ko, pdnabus.ko)
=====================================================================

Copyright (C) United Electronic Industries, Inc. (UEI), except where
noted below.

This directory contains works distributed under different licenses.
Each file is licensed as stated in its own header (SPDX-License-Identifier
line or license notice). The full text of every license is in the
LICENSES/ directory. This file summarizes the licenses of the files built
into the ARM (SoloX) kernel modules, see Makefile.arm. If this summary
and a file header disagree, the file header applies.

