Files not built for the ARM (SoloX) target
------------------------------------------
Files under arch/powerpc/, build/ and other non-ARM build trees are not
covered by this summary. They carry their own license headers (including
GPL-2.0 Linux USB serial drivers and Micrium uC/OS sources).


Per-file header format
----------------------
Every source file should start with an SPDX identifier and a copyright
line, for example:

   // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
   /* Copyright (C) 2006-2026 United Electronic Industries, Inc. */

   // SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-UEI-PowerDNA
   /* Copyright (C) 2020-2026 United Electronic Industries, Inc. */

   /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1 */

The SPDX line replaces the full license text currently pasted into each
file header.
